[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7561.43, "timestamp": "02:06:01", "text": "是因為我，因為我說話磕磕巴巴的，然後我就想，我到底"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7562.95, "timestamp": "02:06:02", "text": "做錯了什麼？我說錯了什麼，他們才會離開？然後我就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7573.35, "timestamp": "02:06:13", "text": "在角落哭，責怪自己。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7584.149, "timestamp": "02:06:24", "text": "現在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7586.709, "timestamp": "02:06:26", "text": "不會那樣了，我會想，好吧，我明白了，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7597.447, "timestamp": "02:06:37", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7604.149, "timestamp": "02:06:44", "text": "事情的發生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7606.709, "timestamp": "02:06:46", "text": "是有原因的。兄弟，別管我，只要說聲“怎麼了”，一切都會好起來的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7618.31, "timestamp": "02:06:58", "text": "怎麼了兄弟"}]